I will share a case with you.

4
00:00:10,440 --> 00:00:14,880
I am Dr. Hyma Prasad, Psychologist.

5
00:00:14,900 --> 00:00:18,660
In the cases I dealt with recently,

6
00:00:18,780 --> 00:00:20,360
a boy had communication...

7
00:00:20,440 --> 00:00:22,380
He studies very well,

8
00:00:22,420 --> 00:00:23,940
gets good marks,

9
00:00:23,980 --> 00:00:25,140
everything is very good.

10
