On paper, he is very good, excellent.

11
00:00:28,660 --> 00:00:30,820
But when made to sit and speak,

12
00:00:30,860 --> 00:00:32,140
he fears English.

13
00:00:32,220 --> 00:00:35,180
He fears talking to the person opposite.

14
00:00:35,260 --> 00:00:37,580
To go and take coaching anywhere,

15
00:00:37,620 --> 00:00:39,460
he is afraid to go to coaching.

16
00:00:39,780 --> 00:00:42,660
With so many fears,

17
00:00:42,740 --> 00:00:44,480
he couldn't face interviews.

18
00:00:44,520 --> 00:00:46,540
Going to interviews, failing.

19
00:00:46,560 --> 00:00:48,640
Going to interviews, failing.

20
00:00:48,680 --> 00:00:50,480
Why is all this happening?

21
00:00:50,500 --> 00:00:52,360
Mainly, nowadays,

22
00:00:52,400 --> 00:00:55,440
