23
00:00:55,480 --> 00:00:58,740
Because every subject you study is in English.

24
00:00:58,780 --> 00:01:00,780
Even so, why does that boy fear?

25
00:01:00,900 --> 00:01:04,900
Because he looks at an interview under a magnifying glass.

26
00:01:04,940 --> 00:01:08,640
From childhood, to speak to anyone...

27
00:01:08,740 --> 00:01:11,860
Why does this happen? The subject with you

28
00:01:11,900 --> 00:01:14,880
